eo game, and as a bonus she'll even throw in a cool item or power! Can't possibly be a bad choice, right? Except he arrives with no money at all, dead average skills, and his \"bonus\" isn't useful at all--since he picked the goddess, Aqua, herself. How are the two of them supposed to defeat the evil Devil King and live happily ever after? Well, for them, it probably starts with day laboring rather than adventuring. And it's only going to get more disappointing from there!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Isekai","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Satire","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":73,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Masochism","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Chuunibyou","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reincarnation","rank":66,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Meta","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dullahan","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":51,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":42,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dungeon","rank":38,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Succubus","rank":37,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world!","english":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world!","native":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！","romaji":"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","so